# Projects smoothapt ingests, one per line:
#
#   <github-repo>  <archive>  <suite>  <workflow>  <releases>
#
# archive   reprepro archive under /var/lib/smoothapt/archives (served as
#           /<archive>/): "public", or "smoothrouter" for the per-user one.
# workflow  the workflow file whose attestations a package must carry; any
#           other signer (another repo, another workflow, a PR run) is refused.
# releases  "stable": only full releases (a v* tag) -- a prerelease means the
#           pipeline built it, not that it is promoted to users.
#           "all": prereleases too.
RakuenSoftware/smoothkernel  public  common  release.yml  stable
